# When a system enforces invariants across multiple coupled (preference)

Standing user preference: When a system enforces invariants across multiple coupled layers, ensure all layers are consistently validated together rather than in isolation.

## Conventions
- When a system enforces invariants across multiple coupled layers, ensure all layers are consistently validated together rather than in isolation.

